[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 10921.51, "timestamp": "03:02:01", "text": "えっと、ゲーマーの息子はベールですか？もしあなたが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10924.309, "timestamp": "03:02:04", "text": "今チャットにいる場合は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10926.95, "timestamp": "03:02:06", "text": "ギフト設定をオンにすると、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10929.309, "timestamp": "03:02:09", "text": "ギフトを受け取る"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10931.67, "timestamp": "03:02:11", "text": "その他。保留中の贈り物のようなもの、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10936.349, "timestamp": "03:02:16", "text": "右？えっと、Rokuが3回やったから"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10940.469, "timestamp": "03:02:20", "text": "回。 1 2 3。 3回。それで"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10942.63, "timestamp": "03:02:22", "text": "持っていない３人"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10946.95, "timestamp": "03:02:26", "text": "会員であれば、無料で入手できます。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10950.701, "timestamp": "03:02:30", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "pin a message"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10957.309, "timestamp": "03:02:37", "text": "うん、それは役に立つだろう。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10959.83, "timestamp": "03:02:39", "text": "推測。メッセージを固定する。ああ、そうだね。はい。はい。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10960.92, "timestamp": "03:02:40", "text": "はい。はい。 はい。そうする必要がある。えっと"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 10964.7, "timestamp": "03:02:44", "text": "はい。そうする必要がある。えっと [音楽]"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 10973.871, "timestamp": "03:02:53", "author": "@kronosMonke", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/u5R_PAWdwUdS05VsH3X9UsOPhhDkvp9L56mdw35mAubmJfUNuvcEeYcJ70Z5Hh_SFtAZe4NL2w=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "PLS- turn on your Allow Gifts feature in your membership settings"}]